WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.060
In this lesson, you will learn to find and fix more than one bug in a script by testing after each fix.

2
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:10.460
Sometimes there is more than one bug.

3
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.770
Find one, fix it, then test again.

4
00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:16.110
Watch where it goes wrong FIRST.

5
00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:17.360
Fix that one.

6
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.690
Run it again.

7
00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.430
Is there another bug?

8
00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:24.280
Keep going until it works.

9
00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.820
Detectives keep looking.

10
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.400
Every bug you fix makes you a better coder.

11
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:34.030
Two bugs! The duck should go right 2, then down 2 to the pond (star).

12
00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:38.920
The number was wrong AND the arrow was wrong. Two bugs squashed!

13
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:42.240
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

14
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.980
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
